    "message": "<p class=\"p1\">Hi; I just enrolled in COMP5331 and am currently looking for a group to join for the course project.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">I am a Ph.D. student in ECE and my background is mainly in Data Science/AI/RL. I’m happy to contribute to both the technical work and the organization of the project.</p>\n<p class=\"p3\">If your group still has an available spot, or if you’re also looking for group members, please feel free to reply here or message me. Email: <a href=\"mailto:wzhouav@connect.ust.hk\" target=\"_blank\">wzhouav@connect.ust.hk</a>; or you can message me via wechat: William030422</p>",
